      ":question/id": "b50a2a9a-6b83-5769-bf16-1b8ff99ffe6c",
      ":question/problem": "Solve the following system of equations:\n    \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} &=-4 \\\\ {x}_{2}-3{x}_{3} &=-4 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=\\frac{7}{3}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$",
